3.84027  0.01              1  0.01
3.996    0.05              1  0.02
4.080    0.11              1  0.03
4.25170  0.29              1  0.03
# B(F) strength to isobaric analog state at 4.384 MeV
# Assumed to be equal to the sum-rule value g_V^2*(N_i - Z_i) with g_V = 1
# Uncertainty derived from the fractional error of the measured
# B(F+GT) = 3.84 +/- 0.17 (Bhattacharya et al. 1998)
4.3837   4.00              0  0.18
4.508    0.31              1  0.05
4.697    0.38              1  0.06
4.765    0.47              1  0.08
4.930    0.36              1  0.09
5.06337  0.23              1  0.07
5.18989  0.03              1  0.03
5.681    0.11              1  0.04
6.118    0.13              1  0.05
